{"id":"e33b11bbdf","t":"Hawar in the Winter Garden","c":"mg:/uploads/series/6af3d5ccdb144e785211e8ee.webp","n":27,"l":27,"s":["mg"],"k":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden"},"u":1795078033107,"desc":"الأميرة الرابعة لشارلمان ، كانولا إف إنكانا شارلمان. تم طردها من شارلمان بسبب صراع شقيقها على العرش ، وأُبلغت أن عليها أن تتزوج الابن الوحيد لملك طرابلس ، الذي لا تعرف اسمه ولا وجهه. الطريق إلى طرابلس فوق جبال الشتاء الوعرة لحضور حفل زفاف. تلتقي بإثيل ، وريثة طرابلس ، خطيبها ، زوجها المقبل … “يا أمي","type":"ويبتون","status":"مستمر","genres":["خيال","دراما","رومانسي","شوجو","غموض","فانتازيا"],"src":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden"},"chapters":{"1":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"2":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"3":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"4":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"5":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"6":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"7":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"8":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"9":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"10":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"11":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"12":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"13":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"14":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"15":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"16":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"17":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"18":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"19":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"20":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"21":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"22":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"23":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"24":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"25":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"26":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"},"27":{"mg":"hawar-in-the-winter-garden|"}}}